[94.859065, "o", "\r\u001b[2KBuild prerequisites are installed. I’ll query KLEE’s repository and inspect its LLVM version support before cloning/building.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\necho \"== remote refs ==\"\r\ngit ls-remote --tags --heads https://github.com/klee/klee.git 2>&1 | tail -30\r\necho \"== clone metadata ==\"\r\nrm -rf /tmp/klee-src\r\ngit clone --depth 1 https://github.com/klee/klee.git /tmp/klee-src 2>&1 | tail -10\r\necho \"== KLEE HEAD ==\"\r\ngit -C /tmp/klee-src log -1 --oneline\r\ngrep -R \"LLVM_VERSION\\|find_package(LLVM\\|LLVM 1[0-9]\" -n /tmp/klee-src/CMakeLists.txt /tmp/klee-src/cmake 2>/dev/null | head -50\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
