[100.960742, "o", "\r\u001b[2KKLEE master explicitly supports LLVM 15+, so LLVM 16 is suitable. I’ll inspect its solver/CMake options and STP’s build requirements before compiling.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\necho \"== KLEE solver options ==\"\r\ngrep -R \"STP\\|SOLVER\" -n /tmp/klee-src/CMakeLists.txt /tmp/klee-src/cmake /tmp/klee-src/lib/Solver 2>/dev/null | head -100\r\necho \"== KLEE README build ==\"\r\ngrep -R \"ENABLE_SOLVER_STP\\|STP\" -n /tmp/klee-src/README* /tmp/klee-src/docs 2>/dev/null | head -100\r\necho \"== STP remote ==\"\r\ngit ls-remote --heads --tags https://github.com/stp/stp.git 2>&1 | tail -15\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[100.960922, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[101.412026, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
