[112.728166, "o", "\r\u001b[2KSTP needs MiniSat plus GMP/Flex/Bison. I’ll install those and verify the MiniSat development files are present.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\nexport DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive\r\napt-get install -y -qq minisat libgmp-dev 2>&1 | tail -30\r\necho \"== minisat files ==\"\r\ndpkg -L minisat | grep -E \"\\.(h|hpp|so|a)$|/bin/\" | head -100\r\necho \"== ldconfig ==\"\r\nldconfig -p | grep -i minisat || true\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
