[121.251758, "o", "\r\u001b[2KMiniSat headers and libraries are available. I’ll compile and install STP 2.3.4 into `/usr/local`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\nset -e\r\nrm -rf /tmp/stp-build\r\ncmake -S /tmp/stp-src -B /tmp/stp-build -G Ninja \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local \\\r\n  -DENABLE_PYTHON_INTERFACE=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_TESTING=OFF \\\r\n  -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON 2>&1 | tee /tmp/stp-configure.log\r\ncmake --build /tmp/stp-build -j\"$(nproc)\" 2>&1 | tee /tmp/stp-build.log\r\ncmake --install /tmp/stp-build 2>&1 | tee /tmp/stp-install.log\r\nldconfig\r\necho \"== stp ==\"\r\ncommand -v stp\r\nstp --version 2>&1 | head -10\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[121.251907, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
