[133.550449, "o", "\r\u001b[2KSTP 2.3.4 failed against Ubuntu’s system MiniSat in its simplifying solver wrapper. I’ll inspect the exact conflict and choose either a compatibility patch or \r\nSTP’s bundled/updated MiniSat fork.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\necho \"== failing source ==\"\r\nnl -ba /tmp/stp-src/lib/Sat/SimplifyingMinisat.cpp | sed -n \"1,110p\"\r\necho \"== minisat lbool definitions ==\"\r\ngrep -R \"l_Undef\\|l_True\\|class lbool\\|typedef.*lbool\" -n /usr/include/minisat | head -50\r\necho \"== all errors ==\"\r\ngrep -n \"error:\" /tmp/stp-build.log | head -50\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[133.550597, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[133.560841, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
