[167.511726, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll run KLEE’s CMake configuration now, explicitly selecting LLVM 16, STP only, and no uClibc. POSIX runtime support will be enabled.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\nset -e\r\nrm -rf /tmp/klee-build\r\ncmake -S /tmp/klee-src -B /tmp/klee-build -G Ninja \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local \\\r\n  -DLLVM_DIR=/usr/lib/llvm-16/lib/cmake/llvm \\\r\n  -DLLVMCC=/usr/bin/clang-16 \\\r\n  -DLLVMCXX=/usr/bin/clang++-16 \\\r\n  -DSTP_DIR=/usr/local/lib/cmake/STP \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_STP=ON \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_Z3=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_POSIX_RUNTIME=ON \\\r\n  -DENABLE_KLEE_UCLIBC=OFF \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH=/usr/local/lib \\\r\n  -DENABLE_UNIT_TESTS=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SYSTEM_TESTS=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_DOCS=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_DOXYGEN=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_TCMALLOC=ON \\\r\n  2>&1 | tee /tmp/klee-configure.log\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
