[200.020162, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m18\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[200.021033, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe core KLEE compiler built, but the POSIX runtime fails on aarch64 because its x86-specific `__NR_*` syscall constants do not exist. Since the task explicitly\r\nexcludes uClibc and only requires a working KLEE command/header, I’ll first rebuild with POSIX runtime disabled, then verify a simple symbolic execution.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\necho \"== install headers rules ==\"\r\ngrep -R \"install(.*include\\|klee.h\\|PUBLIC_HEADER\" -n /tmp/klee-src/CMakeLists.txt /tmp/klee-src/include /tmp/klee-src/lib 2>/dev/null | head -80\r\necho \"== current build dirs ==\"\r\nls -la /tmp/klee-src/include/klee | head\r\necho \"== configure POSIX off ==\"\r\ncmake -S /tmp/klee-src -B /tmp/klee-build \\\r\n  -DENABLE_POSIX_RUNTIME=OFF \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local \\\r\n  -DLLVM_DIR=/usr/lib/llvm-16/lib/cmake/llvm \\\r\n  -DLLVMCC=/usr/bin/clang-16 \\\r\n  -DLLVMCXX=/usr/bin/clang++-16 \\\r\n  -DSTP_DIR=/usr/local/lib/cmake/STP \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_STP=ON \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_Z3=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_UNIT_TESTS=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SYSTEM_TESTS=OFF \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH=/usr/local/lib 2>&1 | tail -40\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[200.022901, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[200.023266, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[200.1665, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[200.167432, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n== install headers rules ==\r\n/tmp/klee-src/CMakeLists.txt:745:install(FILES include/klee/klee.h DESTINATION include/klee)\r\n/tmp/klee-src/include/klee/klee.h:1:/*===-- klee.h --------------------------------------------------*- C++ -*-===//\r\n/tmp/klee-src/lib/Expr/AssignmentGenerator.cpp:15:#include \"klee/klee.h\"\r\n/tmp/klee-src/lib/Core/Executor.h:493:  /// (e.g. wrong usage of klee.h API)\r\n== current build dirs ==\r\ntotal 56\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 12 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 ..\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 ADT\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 Config\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 Core\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 Expr\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 KDAlloc\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 Module\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root 4096 Nov  1 08:00 Solver\r\n== configure POSIX off ==\r\n-- LLVM directory /usr/lib/llvm-16/lib/cmake/llvm\r\nCMake Warning at CMakeLists.txt:146 (message):\r\n  LLVM was built without assertions but KLEE will be built with them.\r\n\r\n  This might lead to unexpected behaviour.\r\n\r\n\r\n-- Not treating compiler warnings as errors\r\n-- STP solver support enabled\r\n-- Found STP version 2.3.3\r\n-- Using STP shared library\r\n-- STP_DIR: /usr/local/lib/cmake/STP\r\n-- Found Z3 libraries: \"/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libz3.so\"\r\n-- Found Z3 include path: \"/usr/include\"\r\n-- Z3 solver support disabled\r\n-- metaSMT solver support disabled\r\n-- Zlib support enabled\r\n-- TCMalloc support enabled\r\n-- Found libutil /usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libutil.a\r\n-- Found libutil include dir /usr/include\r\n-- SELinux support disabled\r\n-- KLEE_RUNTIME_BUILD_TYPE: Debug+Asserts\r\n-- 32bit platform supported: 0\r\n-- POSIX runtime disabled\r\n-- Skipping copying of klee-uclibc runtime\r\n-- libc++ support disabled\r\n-- CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS: \r\n-- KLEE_GIT_SHA1HASH: 78df9e234fdb806530184ecd8963268da87418c5\r\n-- KLEE_COMPONENT_EXTRA_INCLUDE_DIRS: '/usr/lib/llvm-16/include;/usr/include;/usr/include'\r\n-- KLEE_COMPONENT_CXX_DEFINES: '-D_GNU_SOURCE -D__STDC_CONSTANT_MACROS -D__STDC_FORMAT_MACROS -D__STDC_LIMIT_MACROS'\r\n-- KLEE_COMPONENT_CXX_FLAGS: '-UNDEBUG;-fno-exceptions;-fno-builtin-malloc;-fno-builtin-calloc;-fno-builtin-realloc;-fno-builtin-free'\r\n-- KLEE_SOLVER_LIBRARIES: 'stp'\r\n-- LIB_BC_SUFFIX: 64_Release;64_Release+Debug;64_Release+Asserts;64_Release+Debug+Asserts;64_Debug;64_Debug+Asserts\r\n-- KLEE_RUNTIME_DIRECTORY: /tmp/klee-build/runtime/lib\r\n-- Testing is disabled\r\n-- Unit tests disabled\r\n-- System tests disabled\r\n-- Configuring done (0.1s)\r\n-- Generating done (0.0s)\r\n-- Build files have been written to: /tmp/klee-build\r\n\r\n"]
