[253.353825, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m24\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[253.354591, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe end-to-end test generated two paths and confirmed KLEE is using STP/MiniSat. I’ll do a final explicit backend check and verify the environment from a fresh \r\nsourced shell.\r\n\r\n```\r\nbash -lc '\r\nset -e\r\nsource ~/.bashrc\r\necho \"== resolution ==\"\r\ncommand -v klee\r\nprintf \"CPATH=%s\\n\" \"$CPATH\"\r\ntest -n \"$CPATH\"\r\ntest -f /usr/local/include/klee/klee.h\r\necho \"== explicit STP backend ==\"\r\nrm -rf /tmp/klee_stp_out\r\ntimeout 120 klee --solver-backend=stp --output-dir=/tmp/klee_stp_out /tmp/klee_smoke.bc 2>&1 | grep -E \"Using .* solver|generated tests|completed paths\"\r\necho \"== package check ==\"\r\nklee --version | head -6\r\nldd \"$(command -v klee)\" | grep libstp\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[253.355841, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[253.407288, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[253.407534, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n== resolution ==\r\n/usr/local/bin/klee\r\nCPATH=/usr/local/include:/usr/local/include\r\n== explicit STP backend ==\r\nKLEE: Using STP solver backend\r\nKLEE: done: completed paths = 2\r\nKLEE: done: partially completed paths = 0\r\nKLEE: done: generated tests = 2\r\n== package check ==\r\nKLEE 3.4-pre (https://klee-se.org/)\r\n  Build mode: Release (Asserts: ON)\r\n  Build revision: 78df9e234fdb806530184ecd8963268da87418c5\r\n\r\nUbuntu LLVM version 16.0.6\r\n  Optimized build.\r\n        libstp.so.2.3 => /usr/local/lib/libstp.so.2.3 (0x0000ecea9f920000)\r\n\r\n"]
[253.410014, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25l"]
